{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QCSNebGjzC1794383706.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>蔡天鳳肢解案續審，前大伯鄺港傑作供指，弟弟鄺港智殺死蔡天鳳。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205744-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E8%82%A2%E8%A7%A3%E6%A1%88%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%A7%E4%BC%AF%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E4%BD%9C%E4%BE%9B%E5%BC%9F%E5%BC%9F%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E6%AE%BA%E6%AD%BB%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳肢解案｜前大伯鄺港傑作供：弟弟鄺港智殺死蔡天鳳</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205723-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E6%A1%88%E7%99%BC%E5%89%8D%E7%B4%84%E5%8D%8A%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E6%87%89%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%B3%BC%E5%84%B2%E7%89%A9%E7%AE%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港傑︰案發前約半個月應父親要求購儲物箱</strong></a></p><p></p><p>前立法會議員黃錦輝在中大校園內酒後駕駛，今日在沙田裁判法院應訊，他承認不小心駕駛等四項控罪。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205678-%E9%BB%83%E9%8C%A6%E8%BC%9D%E6%B6%89%E9%85%92%E9%A7%95%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E6%89%BF%E8%AA%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%B0%8F%E5%BF%83%E9%A7%95%E9%A7%9B%E7%AD%89%E5%9B%9B%E9%A0%85%E6%8E%A7%E7%BD%AA%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E5%AE%98%E6%8A%BC%E5%BE%8C%E8%87%B3%E6%9C%AC%E6%9C%8826%E6%97%A5%E5%88%A4%E5%88%91\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>黃錦輝涉酒駕事件｜承認不小心駕駛等四項控罪　裁判官押後至本月26日判刑</strong></a></p><p></p><p>東涌西站月台被指部分支柱混凝土「未到頂」。發展局局長甯漢豪指，事件正反映目前的監察及抽查機制發揮作用。另外，赤柱豪宅ONE STANLEY一間獨立屋，被揭發部分鋼絲網及鋼筋配置與圖則不符，甯漢豪指屋宇署會就檢控工作徵詢律政司。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205714-%E6%9D%B1%E6%B6%8C%E8%A5%BF%E7%AB%99%E6%9C%88%E5%8F%B0%E6%B7%B7%E5%87%9D%E5%9C%9F%E6%94%AF%E6%9F%B1%E6%9C%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E7%94%AF%E6%BC%A2%E8%B1%AA%E5%8F%8D%E6%98%A0%E7%9B%A3%E5%AF%9F%E5%8F%8A%E6%8A%BD%E6%9F%A5%E6%A9%9F%E5%88%B6%E7%99%BC%E6%8F%AE%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>東涌西站月台混凝土支柱「未到頂」　甯漢豪︰反映監察及抽查機制發揮作用</strong></a></p><p></p><p>入境處計劃擴展「無感e-道」至港珠澳大橋香港口岸入境大堂。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205724-%E5%85%A5%E5%A2%83%E8%99%95%E6%93%AC%E6%93%B4%E5%B1%95%E7%84%A1%E6%84%9Fe%E9%81%93%E8%87%B3%E6%B8%AF%E7%8F%A0%E6%BE%B3%E5%A4%A7%E6%A9%8B%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E5%85%A5%E5%A2%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%A0%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>入境處擬擴展「無感e-道」至港珠澳大橋香港口岸入境大堂</strong></a></p><p></p><p>廉署2023年搗破圍標集團，落案起訴23人，分拆為5宗案審理，其中一宗在區域法院開審。案件涉及觀塘興達大廈2,000萬元大維修工程。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205715-%E5%BB%89%E7%BD%B22023%E5%B9%B4%E6%90%97%E7%A0%B4%E5%9C%8D%E6%A8%99%E9%9B%86%E5%9C%98%E8%90%BD%E6%A1%88%E8%B5%B7%E8%A8%B423%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%97%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%96%BC%E5%8D%80%E5%9F%9F%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E9%96%8B%E5%AF%A9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>廉署2023年搗破圍標集團落案起訴23人　其中一宗案件於區域法院開審</strong></a></p><p></p><p>政府計劃為政府僱員推出「照顧家庭假」，每人每年最多12小時，容許僱員在特定情況下，短暫離開工作崗位，包括陪同家人應診、照顧患病家人、出席子女的學校活動，以及處理家中突發事宜。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205701-%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%93%AC%E7%82%BA%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%83%B1%E5%93%A1%E6%8E%A8%E7%85%A7%E9%A1%A7%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E5%81%87%E6%AF%8F%E4%BA%BA%E6%AF%8F%E5%B9%B4%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A12%E5%B0%8F%E6%99%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>政府擬為政府僱員推「照顧家庭假」　每人每年最多12小時</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:55:13.806797+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":617,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T23:19:15.792149+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:48:38.380872+00:00","content_hash":"5bf1430e52d6248e83b063eb1a5edce18cacced62a73da3cdeccefbbcaef3f68","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:55:13.806797+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}